---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="Terms & Conditions | padhDSA Visual Algorithm Learning Platform"
  description="padhDSA Terms & Conditions of Use: Educational usage terms, intellectual property, and platform guidelines."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto space-y-8 py-6 sm:py-10">
    
    {/* Page Header */}
    <div class="space-y-2 border-b border-textSecondary/20 pb-6 text-center sm:text-left">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-focusBg border border-focusBorder text-focusText text-xs font-mono font-extrabold px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full uppercase tracking-wider">
        <span>TERMS OF SERVICE</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-main tracking-tight">Terms & Conditions</h1>
      <p class="text-xs font-mono text-textSecondary font-bold">Effective Date: January 1, 2026 • Last Updated: August 2026</p>
    </div>

    {/* Content Card */}
    <div class="bg-card/90 backdrop-blur-xl border border-textSecondary/20 rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-md space-y-6 text-textSecondary text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed font-medium">
      
      <div class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-main flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>🎓 1. Educational Usage License</span>
        </h2>
        <p>
          padhDSA provides visual algorithm interactive engines, code models, and learning guides for non-commercial educational use. Students and educators are welcome to use our tools to study computer science principles.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-main flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>💡 2. Intellectual Property Rights</span>
        </h2>
        <p>
          All custom visual designs, animation engines, code playgrounds, audio feedback models, and educational content are protected intellectual property of padhDSA.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-2">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-black text-main flex items-center gap-2">
          <span>⚠️ 3. Disclaimer of Warranty</span>
        </h2>
        <p>
          Learning visualizers and interactive tools are provided on an "as-is" basis. While we maintain complete accuracy in algorithm time complexity and step execution, padhDSA makes no warranties regarding uninterrupted service.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="pt-4 border-t border-textSecondary/15 flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <p class="text-xs font-mono font-bold text-textSecondary">Questions regarding terms?</p>
        <a
          href="/contact"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-focusBg border border-focusBorder text-focusText text-xs font-mono font-extrabold px-4 py-2 rounded-xl hover:scale-105 transition-transform"
        >
          <span>Contact Legal Team ✉️</span>
        </a>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
